  "description": "Dominant Alpha Grayson Miller has one life goal: finding his one true love, and upon seeking a fortune teller’s advice, he is promised two things: they work with fire, and they have a chest that is out of this world. When Grayson passes out at a fiery accident from a dominant Omega’s pheromones, he wakes up convinced he’s finally found the one. Taking a job at the local fire station to track down his mystery match, his first day sparks an immediate, explosive rivalry with a fellow firefighter named Dane. Has Grayson met his match, or is he about to get burned?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
